{
  "module": "kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "bc3ba265d07fb346eddbb823d3458a6d",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_1",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "f3bab2f222ba85b9fc09cccb7c543e1736a458fdca74dcda123a936fb746cbcd",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "目覚ましに起こされ、%YOU%は少し億劫そうに身を起こした。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "edaaa4dabe3e766cadf104d9ba89482d",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_1",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "f6ef73eb4ad456d7957494a7d98f06877bd6a1a12b10983e46367a33d054903e",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "冬はとりわけ眠りを誘う季節だが、それでも%YOU%はすぐに眠気を振り払った。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "f0dfe67330f0d54cebfd32109d1b6453",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_1",
        2
      ],
      "originalHash": "8d506b17dedbd6dfe08b02abbaff38e05b401f2f412637043386da890e5f562a",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "今日は選抜レースの開催期間であり、名簿で気になっていた%UMA%が出走する日でもある。いつもより早く起きて当然だった。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "de3beaf6b52ea166f8cd4f2582c09e14",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_1",
        6
      ],
      "originalHash": "b0082918025a364835f60cb19696986959ba7023005b2c43e1eb51082e72f470",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "まだ担当の決まっていない%UMA%が実力を示す場であり、担当を探しているトレーナーが%UMA%を見極め、契約を申し込む場でもある。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "e11755e0a714fccd85c736c7ab2ed944",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_1",
        8,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "eb69c5969dfb8a60c72d9f0232e49dfd7e8d9b31830a7ac2436c07cc146fdbc8",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "「おいおい、あのピンク髪の%UMA%見たか？ あれが優秀な%UMA%を輩出してきた【メジロ家】のメジロマックイーンだぞ！」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "6561b4ea949e7dbcd09e95ac5f2959f7",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_1",
        9,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "b3134cd02f8253817211df1c7659e495616051a0719bfcc8c0e999ef72307644",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "「わかるわかる。メジロ家の%UMA%に会えるなんてな。入学前の検査でも優秀なスタミナを持ってるって話だし、選抜での走りが楽しみだ。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "a880241db1cb6c725b5550e84b7317c8",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_1",
        10
      ],
      "originalHash": "69b58a319bab322a62c27b77e0f849b538b02cc9356c63bb27c42a05f82f1ddc",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "%YOU%は隣の二人の噂話を耳にしながら、その特徴どおりの%UMA%を見つけた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "7231bfbcf1a399efa4aa1195778af14a",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_1",
        11
      ],
      "originalHash": "8b3b58097a3c91b1b943f9397c14eb93a1da00ecd40d9f826d9353c67aa6309d",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "自分が気になっていた%UMA%でもあった。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "87a0b0d46b62c157d78df44b95205483",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_1",
        12
      ],
      "originalHash": "1c34dc4c7839c0b04206da69dc626f9d7fce1f046d9884ec5f34facef5f0a5d5",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "メジロマックイーン……%SEX%はゲートの外で、ひそかに自分を奮い立たせている。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "e0bd970e9b5be976e7cdfe8a1e5fe7a5",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_1",
        13
      ],
      "originalHash": "1a6181f0242a36300adc1af9b7998a2d6f0c308b88e7e1f52273bd2d0056bbdf",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "優秀な%UMA%が集う学園では、選抜レースで勝つこと自体がすでに挑戦だ。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "36bfe90720b45d5634447eef03411fa3",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_1",
        15
      ],
      "originalHash": "fc6097a89ba1b533bb1fe120d068e8806c202a86b919bdd1c02d64b54998f510",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "やがてゲートインの合図が鳴り、マックイーンは他の%UMA%とともにゲートへ入る。扉が開いた瞬間、飛び出した。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "30c7b010ed40d5511a844676dd12dc11",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_1",
        23,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "d753123beb4598f428f1d0303cbf894b0dba11a3eabf83e357f7246779641e11",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "「でも先頭でゴールした%UMA%、イナリワンはいい脚をしてるな。うちのチームに迎えてしっかり鍛えれば、大きく伸びるはずだ！」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "95455f4b5e2bfe7fd8ae7521823db31a",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_1",
        25
      ],
      "originalHash": "418e30f181dcdb7851bb0c0d67679c84595f9c6a38059ae3d480317b1e158a0f",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "%YOU%は人だかりに囲まれて戸惑うイナリワンと、コース上で気まずいほど元気のないマックイーンを見ていた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "0546b6be8c449e774836d094b9ff1990",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_1",
        26
      ],
      "originalHash": "03a58639dc2d9e74120ebcbaa0269a245a9bb9c2e6589ac27c7d7295a39720e0",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "決断を迫られる%YOU%の呼吸が、少し荒くなる。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "b5d9054dde93aad591557d3f61ec23c4",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_1",
        28,
        "lines",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "819b059749841fe80f8c7fbfec9ffc3fc0fdb050630451b64b22c8f2534607d5",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "決意した%YOU%は、マックイーンに声をかけようと歩み寄る。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "c82255cce6ef15cb2981d88dc714e464",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_1",
        28,
        "lines",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "b92304c1e8eaa10f685d3d76e3fc6aaa5803deb3ef118de975ea2395c7090e66",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "だが探したときには、%SEX%の姿は悄然と遠ざかっていた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "d69775241820f116a0cb073a3070f53b",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_1",
        28,
        "lines",
        2
      ],
      "originalHash": "948d5f54a5184ac085750eab077cf571c8b5601deca6e73f8568f318851219d0",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "%YOU%は気配を察して足を止め、遠ざかる背中を見送った。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "896cf0ed6d3186b88868d861e787a051",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_1",
        29,
        "lines",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "7f4d6b7b91916acebf425360b3838ee046bc4678a104c7671878a674d9fc3c94",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "今の様子を見て、失望した%YOU%は選抜レースの場を離れた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "f3ab7c2aab99926fbf9ce624db4734f8",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_2",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "304cd6dab486039b62863f2af38ada15d589ebbce5972f4673fd44a29320754b",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "マックイーンの姿が頭から離れず、運を試すつもりで%YOU%は再びトレーニング場へ足を運んだ。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "f68cac1e3ea11a9c810bbab10fed38a7",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_2",
        3
      ],
      "originalHash": "def82397ed28ebcfbbede873b172dc2480085509ea964569f4040c653c106f8b",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "%YOU%は近くの柵に寄って、その練習を眺めた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "b51a95f1cec1480ce4d681003225a49c",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_2",
        6
      ],
      "originalHash": "d20b692c85e1efc8b83b597fc6e794e04db22c3a34977d00b94dd2e4b54bb6ac",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "会話の隙を捉えた%YOU%は歩み寄り、笑顔を作って、目の前のメジロ家の%YOUNG_LADY%に少し堅く声をかけた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "549ef2c80f993ba1df058eeffb6c25d7",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_2",
        7,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "d31aa43d409bad251c64ceb731ce76009ea41a8b2d0f28ab2d6d507c36b59e2b",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "「こんにちは、メジロマックイーン%YOUNG_LADY%。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "fb4c2181f933916e6b43a8b046357d23",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_2",
        9
      ],
      "originalHash": "6535cf46176d93dd3b6c530c145d924d58d6ca03e82d70d824bc0a33c5a4d1a7",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "%YOU%の到来に気づいたマックイーンは、驚いたように%YOU%を見た。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "0bc5231a26edf7c771e3327044eb51f3",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_2",
        13
      ],
      "originalHash": "0516b531caaaf83e431b14a9f01db9d90bc88b6975bdcb8387b96f4b94f5e258",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "マックイーンは%YOU%を観察し、少し黙ってから、困惑したように続けた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "6bdc5e943a915e4c7ce3238443aaa04d",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_2",
        14,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "ac664f167a49d3ddd1354b722e3a11e89eca30a5bc8db2ccf08d4793178d6940",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "「ですが……なぜ%CALLNAME%は、わたくしに興味を持たれたのでしょう。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "f373d0f0ba858fc0e2d4a0019501ae2f",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_2",
        16
      ],
      "originalHash": "1435ca496de6cac37e16bb5b4e2e8d3a6352e343d3f315276c5c47a5987b7237",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "昨日を思い出した%SEX%自身も、少し溜息をつく。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "61771f9578320196ac85d0562c3d5604",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_2",
        19
      ],
      "originalHash": "1bc2a9e08cff6c8b61edbf0cce6f34dfe093a6cd6df03d7e1eedf7147d143e27",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "%YOU%はそう答えた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "cea05ca34559121f31970f4fe12034a3",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_2",
        21
      ],
      "originalHash": "3453db2cbb883b6d6e27192e6bc867f0603cb366e9e4afce2e3704b3b320d400",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "「でもマックイーン%YOUNG_LADY%は違う。あの状況でも沈まず、練習を続けている。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "005db1ab450dfa9bb32750a056201e0c",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_2",
        23
      ],
      "originalHash": "76271d9570762b8d54836da1ff4302bd8a819efe673892154b7de0feb1eb5efc",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "マックイーンは恐縮したように%YOU%を見て、それから小さく微笑んだ。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "4f1a0c0c3104c57e0220bd6a826d109f",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_2",
        24,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "118fe51b879cd2ea6807a6fb7bcab28cff237159e20e70973b44b17481133018",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "「お上手ですこと、%CALLNAME%。精神の在り方まで見ていらっしゃるのですね。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2593d39c26e0fe7b3f8a27ea2f26ea23",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_2",
        25,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "7a64354f8f896b18c55cd33d966b1e2ac0924f0126215b3e8d5dd6eac9dd899e",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "「メジロ家の%UMA%として、いついかなる時も強い心を保たねばなりませんわ。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "8c76effd8a0782f1dc54dbbcd737411f",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_2",
        28,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "2937dd70000b2a7539873d316a6d28950f8c7fc50e4aa5e8c3e98fa8d8a3c433",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "「メジロ家の%UMA%として、遠大な目標を成し遂げねばなりませんの。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "9b1a3418ee9ba87957a7de964654c6e5",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_2",
        35,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "b1f131ae55abe5bc5d8b4f8e40a9652900faa9c86eb0cc82be2ccb259a7a9cb7",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "「名実ともにメジロ家の%UMA%である姿を見て、それでも契約なさるか。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "002d76e65a1b7fd1451a8336a61881b2",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_2",
        36
      ],
      "originalHash": "e70c2bf135c263ba725a768dc935f81ec381939dd4ad61bc5049a76f8159c034",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "マックイーンの言葉を聞いて、%YOU%は思わず頷いた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "4ef9d1b95f0accef6d00c1d0fc4c83a0",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_2",
        37,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "3b08170edd106869a5ac4319bd1c2c22c32e27687e4db81e06d40f0e608f5f19",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "「休憩時間がちょうど終わりましたわ。では、%CALLNAME%、ご覧くださいませ。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "92a2dca2128117660fe2475b5bf99680",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_2",
        49
      ],
      "originalHash": "c230d1e49a87afaf067bbb45e18654258468ef079b3d701e2f4e126c386138c4",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "マックイーンのお腹が音を立て、%SEX%はお腹を押さえて小さく悲鳴を漏らした。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "e1b126937c673ef895b3f48cf50945e0",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_2",
        52
      ],
      "originalHash": "3b741a9d3662eb78a15a06c6877405bb7a422d6b1c9ba031f2473ae68b628510",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "%YOU%はマックイーンに近づき、心配そうに尋ねる。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "356c310c545ad0546d5c1c9708854384",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_2",
        58
      ],
      "originalHash": "f5bf00fb77de7c0442da1a8d84d070c26d5619e911bf8d792cb8c93544d87786",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "%YOU%が事情を整理する前に、マックイーンはまた走り出していた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "d6a489c538b083a1eeaa9b06bba65ff5",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_2",
        60
      ],
      "originalHash": "8321bf04469a14ef26880a3b2aea8dc574a75c48e72ea007f24497b9cb3ac4ca",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "%YOU%が引き止めるより早く、数歩走ったあと、%SEX%の身体が倒れた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "50d95996f56c2baabec9ff30f3bd5484",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_2",
        61,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "9b4ecd962f1881db31a07e640a3f11bacf71c961e9116b10b2e1d683cf808d95",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "「マックイーン%YOUNG_LADY%！！」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "7656b3b052a28bc578a75ae41d380c2c",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_2",
        62
      ],
      "originalHash": "ba26e2828f7b5ef9d7d774d56378e6852cbd3e1f46b4aa73fb64b831edbf68de",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "慌てて駆け寄り、%SEX%の傍らで身体を確認する。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "cbf6d3a406536200e0af507023f8319a",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_2",
        65
      ],
      "originalHash": "a670294ab985efeb831972c1ccbe56cfe1cea74524a1c8fc24ab083ddd9bc9d5",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "%YOU%は仕方なく、気を失ったマックイーンを抱え、保健室へ向かった。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "e08f8f58cde240ab43a13766b0506c93",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_2",
        67
      ],
      "originalHash": "5b96a2e453c1daedaae3a1dff2cfacb3fd35c532a53ae5628c151c7336364cbc",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "夕方。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "3b020a59ae1e64cf7cf69e62a25d8880",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_2",
        70
      ],
      "originalHash": "3e5d6efcc73493f797196abc1637d0593b177829e9c713b60ebc40251af61dd4",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "%YOU%はまだ昏いマックイーンのベッドの傍らに座り、目覚めを待った。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "c8bb3cfd022760d6737e6de2b44cd810",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_2",
        71
      ],
      "originalHash": "5ba87ba680bbfd7b423854a4eebc8cc34e13229897d44fe305600f7509e3dfbb",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "静かな保健室にマックイーンの小さな呻きが聞こえて、ようやく%YOU%は気づく。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "33ed2a53e1eb968dbc48fb50160e92f8",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_2",
        75
      ],
      "originalHash": "fc8013dfa60696f49cff658537dbfa15a1bb006c8a98a404de8bb79bca948bc0",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "%YOU%は貧血のことをマックイーンに伝えた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "51d305aa56931761535387f746025ac2",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_2",
        77,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "650972747187d834579853adf6dcb7a9f863350a067699ba64f5b3bc1613c3dc",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "「ご心配をおかけして申し訳ありません、%CALLNAME%。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "1c035ede2c2a48cde5d6a11420b0cf3a",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_2",
        81
      ],
      "originalHash": "96cc209f5dd9a9124f42928ba4ff7d073526f18241b660fd7cce60334c9b6bf5",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "%YOU%はマックイーンを見て、小さく笑った。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "4e3869aaa8b5a9a6ad81c87229ff77b5",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_2",
        84,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "a6b6f14a99c54c790d0cbc35d3057f98691cf57e5484f67fe640bda61b4d5d81",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "「もちろんですわ！ メジロ家の%UMA%は食事を含め、日常生活のすべてを完璧に整えております。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "404246048198de105cccc6261a963835",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_2",
        87
      ],
      "originalHash": "4f8eb5370c90ccf7f8aaa0edaadf5fdf2a0ceb2c60a0712833ad4dcc85dc545d",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "%YOU%は不満げなその言葉には乗らず、こう尋ねた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "9c54ac62f41d2f6c56691bd3d8cbdc37",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_2",
        92
      ],
      "originalHash": "a19db795ac1cc69520ddb553238c9970b5c1b4856d3dfb0e13f828b191255944",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "最低限の栄養は取れそうだが、%UMA%の消費を支えるには到底足りない。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "8b4453e21c72a5118ed3330b5a63a3c9",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_2",
        95
      ],
      "originalHash": "ab3bbce7fcc4ff44c4b583ed9b9bf8be58373d3880663f9745dc86609e181255",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "%YOU%は信じられないように口にした。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "adfd2a230f24b53c98311d465e67ef7f",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_2",
        100
      ],
      "originalHash": "cd3ef793bd51fa0ee7cf0db4561eaf52df601ec623987e9efcd312f94fdc0e27",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "%YOU%が顔を上げると、%SEX%の顔は熟した林檎のように赤く、視線も泳いでいた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "fd524c49829d0a29c118ca1539e48821",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_2",
        107
      ],
      "originalHash": "e373cce646481887251f3a1796970e1f70c5a70dc0f2ad30674fe7fd18b5ff0f",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "胸の内を吐き出したあと、%SEX%は力なく布団に伏せ、耳を伏せた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "a67d9b7d99a7517c7cb9940943f39877",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_2",
        109
      ],
      "originalHash": "071df8b0850b68e644c9653ca00e244e8e8ba60484b69ca944825aaecb1dbd0b",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "%YOU%は話を聞き終え、頭を撫でた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "9f8a7d2058b12097e90bbf56d49c5c63",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_2",
        110
      ],
      "originalHash": "ebf424e4d4ca4f435b780157e63420d02f6124b38b95ee52d0a60deb82b04265",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "%SEX%は顔を上げ、少し不解そうに%YOU%を見る。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "ad0d4607da177be50ffb4c0f5cff5c47",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_2",
        117
      ],
      "originalHash": "0a4291e27471b19be45f42bf94081e0fbac9107ebae4ccaedf95eab04bdc9e10",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "%YOU%は頷いて礼を言った。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "3ef32b7479b2be727af1ed6b246aa400",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_2",
        120
      ],
      "originalHash": "d167eb8775d3f495be27b46f8d7b869eb3b146cc79823917a3957f7e737b7d73",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "%YOU%は立ち上がり、メニューをしまった。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "58c556e67e2ef21d0078e2d5288b5d5f",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
