      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_2",
        124
      ],
      "originalHash": "e60e981bafbbbaf9bf0db1a7d12d84433cec51b6685a3bc0b9f8588ff478d630",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "その日、%YOU%はパソコンの前で遅くまで起きていた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "89d8b6dc6b504ec900685970a944cd03",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_3",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_3",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "a2e68d83002595187b3b2a823dd321c7aaa28296f43c5b8d7af42ec8408a6afb",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "翌日、%YOU%はまたマックイーンを見つけた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "009a23b2942101130437e4b9a2509927",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_3",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_3",
        2
      ],
      "originalHash": "c91157fe6469b6968410899203e95154eb616c360aa37ba7a0cc48bc093ff3a7",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "%SEX%もその声に応えてやって来た。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2b1150fbb17f89f1945c8ebbdc9f7229",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_3",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_3",
        6
      ],
      "originalHash": "8fb8eefb87884d09f1827c2a33e1278bd9c018f969faf8d6e24c8fabc87a9de3",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "%YOU%は満足げに頷き、ノートをマックイーンに渡した。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "01382a924b52ca57a4d805861c444d47",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_3",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_3",
        9,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "f85b58b2bbe9354e1b953b70d250dd0c00efd1af0a1f78761907a3712f8d248c",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "「え？ %CALLNAME%のノート、ですの？」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2c3409ba85c587e5281f507920e5070f",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_3",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_3",
        11
      ],
      "originalHash": "b92470354cf3aadebce9b17d84c37d00a127ae067e1ab929140cf6558f5bddd7",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "%SEX%はノートの内容に没頭し、読んでいるあいだ耳が小さく動く。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "0e96df624bac9003e6e6bddcd20258c8",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_3",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_3",
        12,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "6b59d0248a38648c2b96b6430e955928b03e44e6e8939ec72d7c42a1e10a94a6",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "「食材の一覧……脂肪がつきにくいメニュー。これほどまで、%CALLNAME%が調べてくださったのですか？」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "4e4def390194afdf0c5dd09843c6d40c",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_3",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_3",
        13
      ],
      "originalHash": "11ab3133cd84c5cca2330216b2a98169b9b11afefddd8384d097d7a99abef83e",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "%SEX%は小さく独り言を呟く。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "bae15597b8f1188e554b88c6288f54ec",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_3",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_3",
        18,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "2e12bd003434a33df4bb6b31200d3716fe6f9ccffe7acc42f17486880eada3f3",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "「%CALLNAME%……本当にありがとうございます。担当でもないわたくしのために、ここまでしてくださって。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "05e64fdf0dad39828fe05c45d0c9bc2f",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_4",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_4",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "95af744dede918e31bfa28d7a4b7b2e5962b69060fec825f262814707f66e24b",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "%YOU%は再びトレーニング場へ行き、マックイーンの躍進を見届けた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "65343ea12c707a8b6a04f2f0bf30f0bb",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_4",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_4",
        2,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "976d93605f593afedc8040b1ce005f1def27f1827d8f6ed62acd047c9efe03d7",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "「おい、また【メジロ家】の大%YOUNG_LADY%メジロマックイーンか。前回の選抜は七着だったってのに、今日も出るのかよ。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "56d287c28093fddc281a8a68cbc79fcc",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_4",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_4",
        3,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "31e6f437a449364aba4072d389a6b64526a527d49b9abb7d1df7ec1791a3c3cd",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "「그런 말 마세요. 저 %角色敬称%는 곱게만 자란 부류가 아니라고요. 지난주 선발 레이스 이후로 계속해서 피나는 훈련을 해왔으니까요……」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "386abdf34ce95e679e290f2fa385d9ca",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_4",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_4",
        5
      ],
      "originalHash": "aeb97a7059d4b19c4d8c242881b69b902191ebcde1104cad3f782f0975593ebf",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "鋭い目が、あっさり%YOU%を捉える。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "e7c12ff6a8de8ce105296db9c62b8345",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_4",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_4",
        8
      ],
      "originalHash": "f26b4e9b3ee92af54f9af34383819120b16ed8d057a266c565344505bffa82f9",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "それがわかるのは、%YOU%だけだった。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "d3a1d252595176b810af2c6e51968624",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_4",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_4",
        17
      ],
      "originalHash": "642d8b43cd380693f72f7dccc8e7ccd5fd27862924fed0fd0c8e44f27311b3de",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "そのとき%YOU%も、安堵の笑みを隠しきれなかった。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "3801db1fa893722cab28e878a1d8db0c",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_4",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_4",
        28
      ],
      "originalHash": "7f735a34e6632d70f0112b2a779c049ac33fb266ee7d0c3052ebfe99d51ed0a7",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "マックイーンが突然立ち止まり、%YOU%も足を止めた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "d755a3d9c81376b7bdd325c228585a3b",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/rec-13.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_4",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_4",
        30,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "5ad12a4f3e1daf4f5800d5d88e6dcc01c582a9a3dcf294ab516bcb4862d9c2fc",
      "sourceFileHash": "d97f17ff4498028167db3311579b2a73b3741fe33943bd2de757782a29f07d99",
      "originalText": "「わたくしはメジロ家の%UMA%。華麗に、優雅に、完璧な勝利を。それがこの名に課せられた義務ですわ。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    }
  ]
}
